# Three Dragoons attack Tupi village 31 (43,23, population 3) from (43,24) through the village menu's Attack Village row.
# Start: village_scout_visit's input.sav, fixture-edited through sav_json and re-saved through one no-op replay:
#  - the three Scouts sentried (orders 1);
#  - Dragoon 136 (slot 135) moved from Quebec to (43,24), orders cleared, full moves;
#  - sentried colonists 125 (slot 124, from (43,25)) and 131 (slot 130, from (44,25)) made Dragoons (type 4) at (43,24),
#    orders cleared, full moves; slot 124 is the active unit.
# Combat analysis is on in this save: every attack first shows the analysis box (no popup text), then the result.
# RNG: the combat rolls come from the game stream (the RTST RNG record moves); the outcomes are what this RNG state gives.
# Attack Village sets the attack-confirmed bit (FUN_4d56_4528 case 9 -> FUN_15b3_0066: euro_diplo / relation_by_indian 96 -> 100)
# and keeps the unit's moves for the move/combat itself; each attack raises the Tupi alarm (+9 for France) and tribe attacks.
key KP_8     # Dragoon 125 steps north into the village: menu Demand Tribute / Attack Village / Cancel Action (calm greeting)
key Down
key Return   # Attack Village
wait 3
key Return   # combat analysis box
wait 3
                         #  French win: population 3 -> 2; Dragoon 131 is selected (no outcome popup: #1464/#1465)
key KP_8     # menu again, now the "frown at you suspiciously" greeting (alarm 9)
key Down
key Return   # Attack Village
wait 3
key Return   # combat analysis box
wait 3
                         #  French win again: population 2 -> 1; Dragoon 136 is selected (no outcome popup: #1464/#1465)
key KP_8
key Down
key Return   # Attack Village
wait 3
key Return   # combat analysis box
wait 3
key Return   # "French Dragoons routed! Unit demoted to Soldiers status" (the defender won: no gear taken, FUN_5fef_1b0e gate)
wait 3
                         #  no Dragoon has moves left, Colonist 88 in Guadeloupe is selected (no outcome popup: #1464/#1465)
